    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Midwives Alliance of Asia (MAA) , with the support of the Aga Khan University School of Nursing and Midwifery (AKU-SONAM), hosted its inaugural strategic direction meeting in Islamabad. Dr Rafat Jan, Associate Dean of Outreach & Policy at AKU-SONAM, and President of the  Midwifery Association of Pakistan (MAP) , led the initiative. Dr Salimah Walani, Dean AKU-SONAM was guest of honor at the opening ceremony.",
